l":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-05-08T12:12:55Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:39Z","closed_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in master branch 4 days ago: [[d4dabd15aa85a6c7bb1a62eb412bc8fbe901ac5c](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d4dabd15aa85a6c7bb1a62eb412bc8fbe901ac5c)]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Nobara Linux 40 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER (nvidia; 565.77) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700KF (28 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy web export can no longer read any of my jpg files from user:// (example below).  They worked fine in 4.4.1.  \n\nI see in the web console: \"ERROR: Failed to load image. Error 15. at: load_from_file (core/io/image.cpp:2551) and none of the jpgs load. ERROR 15 appears to be ERR_FILE_UNRECOGNIZED according to core/error/error_list.h. This error is printed when calling Image.load_from_file() with the jpg filename.  \n\nMy other files in user:// load just fine.  Even pngs are fine.  \n\nThis might be due to the change in jpg libraries: [Use libjpeg-turbo for improved jpg compatibility and speed #104347](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347)\n \nI created the export using `scons platform=web target=template_release`\n\nMore details of my efforts here: https://forum.godotengine.org/t/compiled-web-export-template-doesnt-support-jpgs-but-pngs-work/109841\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e040ef9f-9611-4af6-b3fc-aeccd668ac1b)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Image.load_from_file() with the attached file \n2. Build for web (might happen for other builds - haven't tested)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106172/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}